      {
        "name": "terp_auth_types_AuthSudoMsg",
        "description": "`AuthSudoMsg` contains variants of messages that can be sent to the authenticator contract\nfrom smart account module through `CosmWasmAuthenticator`.\n\n`AuthenticateRequest` is `Box`-ed due to large size difference between other variants",
